<title>AUSTRALIA: St Barbara Mines links up with Normandy.</title>
<headline>St Barbara Mines links up with Normandy.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian gold miners St Barbara Mines Ltd and Normandy Mining Ltd said on Monday they hade formed a joint venture in the Cue District of Western Australia.</p>
<p>St Barbara would have a 30 percent interest and Normandy, with a 70 percent stake, would be the operator of the Big Bell Cuddingwarra Consolidated Joint Venture.</p>
